// Title: PUA - CleanWipe Execution
// ID: f44800ac-38ec-471f-936e-3fa7d9c53100
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-12-18
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects the use of CleanWipe a tool usually used to delete Symantec antivirus.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\SepRemovalToolNative_x64.exe")) OR (where(Image IENDSWITH "\\CATClean.exe") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "--uninstall")) OR (where(Image IENDSWITH "\\NetInstaller.exe") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "-r")) OR (where(Image IENDSWITH "\\WFPUnins.exe") AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/uninstall") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/enterprise"))))
